§123.1 (`P_ne_NP_via_step4`): the TM-framed "DTM + 3-SAT + bounded
parameters + Step 4 output → False" theorem, mirroring the
`PeqNP_Paper`-field-by-field consumer shape. The Cook-Levin canonical
